{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-10-25 08:30:00', 'title': 'VERIZON LANDS $78M DIGITAL MODERNIZATION CONTRACT WITH NAVAL DISTRICT WASHINGTON', 'text': "WASHINGTON, OCT. 25, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- VERIZON PUBLIC SECTOR HAS BEEN AWARDED A $78 MILLION TASK ORDER WITH NAVAL DISTRICT WASHINGTON (NDW) THROUGH THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT'S ENTERPRISE INFRASTRUCTURE SOLUTIONS (EIS) CONTRACT VEHICLE. VERIZON PUBLIC SECTOR WILL SERVE AS NDW'S TECHNOLOGY PARTNER, UPDATING THEIR TIME DIVISION MULTIPLEXING (TDM) VOICE PLATFORM TO A HOSTED INTERNET PROTOCOL VOICE SERVICE (IPVS) AT THE AGENCY'S INDIAN HEAD, MD. FACILITY."}